Subject: [PATCH 22/23] rusticc: native AFC for cosmoace_afc (the ACE Pro / ACE
 2 units)

The AFC_ACE plugin in Rust: afcACE, AceSetup, the dryer heater and humidity
sensor (afc/ace.rs) and the serial links on their own threads, the ACE Pro's
framed JSON and the ACE 2's RS-485 bus (afc/ace_transport.rs). Native for
[AFC_ACE], [AFC_ACE <unit>] and the ACE units' [AFC_lane] sections; the
plugin directory is then skipped.

AFC core pieces the Canvas did not use: the unit_load_lane / unit_unload_lane
hooks, get_lane_reset_command, stepperless lane_move, "ACE" in the load-only
lane types, the base unit's LED states and calibration prompts. AFC.log
frame data from AFC_ACE.py (afc_codes.py).

